    challengesLabel: THE CHALLENGES
    challenge: '<p data-start="55" data-end="111"><strong data-start="55" data-end="74">Product import:</strong> Import more than 50,000 spare parts.</p><p data-start="113" data-end="213"><strong data-start="113" data-end="129">Flexibility:</strong> Remain as standard as possible while meeting highly specific business requirements.</p><p data-start="215" data-end="415"><strong data-start="215" data-end="257">Incorrect product type classification:</strong> In the previous Odoo database, goods and services were mixed and sometimes grouped under a single product, causing operational and reporting inconsistencies.</p><p data-start="417" data-end="586"><strong data-start="417" data-end="457">Maintenance subscription management:</strong> Implementing a reliable system to sell, schedule, and automatically invoice recurring maintenance contracts was a key challenge.</p><p data-start="588" data-end="762"><strong data-start="588" data-end="639">Electronic invoicing compliance and automation:</strong> Integration with Peppol was essential to comply with electronic invoicing regulations and streamline accounting processes.</p><p data-start="764" data-end="986" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""><strong data-start="764" data-end="797">Complete customer experience:</strong> Fernatech wanted to provide its customers with a full digital experience, including a website and a customer portal where they could access their invoices, service requests, and documents.</p><img class="aligncenter wp-image-1408 size-full" src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/fernatech.jpg" alt="fernatech" width="1024" height="329" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/fernatech.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/05/fernatech-300x96.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/05/fernatech-768x247.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px">'
    solutionLabel: THE SOLUTION
    solution: <p data-start="55" data-end="221"><strong data-start="55" data-end="84">Full Odoo implementation:</strong> Agitech deployed a centralized ERP solution covering sales, invoicing, subscriptions, field service operations, and customer management.</p><p data-start="223" data-end="317"><strong data-start="223" data-end="261">Automated subscription management:</strong> Creation of maintenance subscription services enabling:</p><ul><li data-start="321" data-end="353">automatic contract generation,</li><li data-start="356" data-end="392">automatic intervention scheduling,</li><li data-start="395" data-end="417">recurring invoicing,</li><li data-start="420" data-end="459">automatic customer confirmation emails.</li></ul><p data-start="461" data-end="559"><strong data-start="461" data-end="507">Stripe and electronic payment integration:</strong> Connection of Stripe terminals with Odoo to enable:</p><ul><li data-start="563" data-end="582">on-site payments,</li><li data-start="585" data-end="629">automatic synchronization with accounting,</li><li data-start="632" data-end="691">reduced errors and significant administrative time savings.</li></ul>
